    "text": "ncktoday.com\nwebsite\nConcordia\nBond Sale, Several Agreements Highlight Wednesday's Concordia City Commission Meeting\n1 days ago\nThe Concordia City Commissioners met Wednesday, August 6 at City Hall and approved a bond sale and several agreements while tabling another. Commissioners approved the issuance of bonds and a public bond sale on October 1 with funds used to complete Sunflower Road and improvements to East 7th Street and 11th Street and Highland Drive near the St. Joseph Subdivision.",
